        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T19:58:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m torn about adding this callback here. On one had it is convenient for the client to add the callback here where they are making the API call. On the other hand, we already have a FinishedProc on Recording insertion which the client can use.",
      "parentUuid": "e381ce6b_b643a21b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 110,
        "startChar": 30,
        "endLine": 110,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "c12db306a627092204a200713ed101fc7594c14b",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3c8cb814_5a833b0d",
        "filename": "include/gpu/graphite/Recorder.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 110,
      "author": {
        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T20:09:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure where ManagedGraphiteTexture::MakeFromPixmap would insert the texture release callback then, since there\u0027s no sign of a Recording there.",
      "parentUuid": "68c13401_752803d1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 110,
        "startChar": 30,
        "endLine": 110,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "c12db306a627092204a200713ed101fc7594c14b",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d69bb47c_738bdb29",
        "filename": "include/gpu/graphite/Recorder.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 110,
      "author": {
        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-20T13:54:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was more concerned that we\u0027re using a GpuFinishedProc -- it sounds like that should only be used when adding the recording. I could create a TextureReleaseProc alias, which would be `void (void*)`",
      "parentUuid": "3c8cb814_5a833b0d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 110,
        "startChar": 30,
        "endLine": 110,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "c12db306a627092204a200713ed101fc7594c14b",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a32055d0_d657847b",
        "filename": "include/gpu/graphite/Recorder.h",
