      },
      "lineNbr": 110,
      "author": {
        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-20T14:03:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But its not a texture release proc in the sense that we\u0027re not actually creating an internal Skia texture (or public image or surface) it connects to. So I think in this case finish proc is the right thing since the client has to wait for this specific operation to finish on the GPU.",
